{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_63_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_63","textTraditional":"一、二年，春，王正月，齊人遷陽。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_63_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_63","textTraditional":"二、夏，五月，乙酉，吉禘於莊公。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_63_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_63","textTraditional":"吉禘者，不吉者也。喪事未畢而舉吉祭，故非之。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_63_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_63","textTraditional":"三、秋，八月，辛丑，公薨。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_63_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_63","textTraditional":"不地，故也。其不書葬，不以討母葬子也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_63_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_63","textTraditional":"四、九月，夫人姜氏孫於邾。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_63_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_63","textTraditional":"孫之為言遜也，諱奔也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_63_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_63","textTraditional":"五、公子慶父出奔莒。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_63_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_63","textTraditional":"其曰出，絕之也，慶父不復見矣。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_63_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_63","textTraditional":"六、冬，齊高子來盟。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_63_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_63","textTraditional":"其曰來，喜之也。其曰高子，貴之也，盟立僖公也。不言使何也？不以齊侯使高子也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_63_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_63","textTraditional":"七、十有二月，狄入衞。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_63_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_63","textTraditional":"八、鄭棄其師。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_63_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_63","textTraditional":"惡其長也，兼不反其眾，則是棄其師也。","sentenceOrder":14}],"overrides":{}}